WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.590
Off Newfoundland, in Canada, the northern
cod fed fishing towns for centuries.

2
00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:09.200
Then factory freezer
trawlers and sonar arrived.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:11.200
Catches grew far bigger.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:15.530
On 2 July 1992, Canada
stopped the fishery.

5
00:00:15.530 --> 00:00:18.430
About 40,000 workers were affected.

6
00:00:18.430 --> 00:00:21.090
Every fisher wanted fish for next year.

7
00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:23.290
So why did they all keep fishing?

8
00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:26.470
In this mission, you'll
follow one extra tonne of fish

9
00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:28.900
and see who gains and who pays.

10
00:00:28.900 --> 00:00:31.010
Then you'll use a graph lab to set how

11
00:00:31.010 --> 00:00:33.340
much a whole fleet should catch.

12
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:36.910
Your mission: explain why
fishers who all want a future

13
00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:38.350
still empty the sea.
